    {
      "title": "Reading an Execution Plan",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Reading an Execution Plan",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. EXPLAIN Modes",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`EXPLAIN`: ==estimated== plan, query not run",
                "`EXPLAIN ANALYZE`: **runs** it, adds real time and row counts",
                "Data-changing statement? Wrap in a transaction, then ==ROLLBACK==",
                "`BUFFERS`: adds page hits and reads"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "BEGIN;",
                "EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)",
                "  DELETE FROM orders WHERE status = 'old';",
                "ROLLBACK;"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Reading the Tree",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Read from the ==innermost== node outward: scans feed joins, joins feed sort/aggregate",
                "`cost=startup..total`, `rows=` estimate, `width=` bytes per row",
                "Estimate vs actual rows gap of ==10x or more== = where the optimizer went wrong; look first"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "output",
              "lines": [
                "Nested Loop (rows=10) (actual rows=50000 loops=1)",
                "  -> Seq Scan on orders (rows=10) (actual rows=50000)",
                "       Rows Removed by Filter: 4950000"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Red Flags and Fix Flow",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Flag",
                "Sign"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Seq Scan",
                  "big table, selective filter"
                ],
                [
                  "Filter",
                  "Rows Removed in the millions"
                ],
                [
                  "Spill",
                  "`external merge`, `Batches > 1`"
                ],
                [
